[out-of-scope #48] Q: Which visits require an ECG?
  -> Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis.pdf

The following visits require a 12-lead ECG:

1. A routine 12-lead ECG will be performed at **Visits 1, 1.1, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, and 9**.
[Section 7.1.5 Electrocardiogram · p.55]

2. During the **Screening Period**, Visit 1.1 includes a 12-lead ECG as part of its procedures.
[Section 6.2.2 Screening Period (Days -28 to -1 prior to Visit 2) · p.49]

3. During the **12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8)**, a 12-lead ECG is required at **all visits** (Visits 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, and 8).
[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) · p.50]

