1. The Investigator must record all adverse events in the Adverse Event Log with the following fields:
   - Adverse event
   - Date of onset (time can be recorded, if applicable)
   - Intensity
   - Causal relationship to IMP
   - Action taken to IMP
   - Other action taken
   - Date and time of outcome
   - Outcome
   - Seriousness
